{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T15:58:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-23T15:58:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Dermapharm Holding SE","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"Germany","city":"Grünwald","website":"https://ir.dermapharm.de","employees":3619,"summary":"Dermapharm Holding SE, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells off-patent branded pharmaceutical products in Germany, Italy, France, Austria, Switzerland, Spain, Portugal, the Netherlands, Croatia, Poland, Ukraine, the United States, and China. The company operates through three segments: Branded Pharmaceuticals; Other Healthcare Products; and Parallel Import Business. It offers branded generics, OTC products, non-prescription healthcare products, and herbal extracts and parallel-imported originator pharmaceuticals. The company also provides vitamins, minerals, food supplements, as well as products for dermatology, allergology, pain and inflammation treatment, cardiovascular support, gynecology, and urology. In addition, it offers cosmetics and medical devices. Further, the company imports originator pharmaceuticals under the axicorp brand. It sells its products under the Dekristol, Keltican, Tromcardin, Ketozolin, bite away, and Herpotherm brands. The company was founded in 1991 and is headquartered in Grünwald, Germany. Dermapharm Holding SE is a subsidiary of Themis Beteiligungs-AG.","exchange":"XETRA","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Dermapharm Holding SE, avec ses filiales, fabrique et vend des produits pharmaceutiques de marque hors brevet en Allemagne, en Italie, en France, en Autriche, en Suisse, en Espagne, au Portugal, aux Pays-Bas, en Croatie, en Pologne, en Ukraine, aux États-Unis et en Chine. La société opère à travers trois segments: Produits pharmaceutiques de marque; Autres produits de santé; et Parallel Import Business. Il propose des génériques de marque, des produits en vente libre, des produits de soins de santé sans ordonnance, des extraits de plantes et des produits pharmaceutiques d'origine importés en parallèle."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":1902367104,"shares_outstanding":49540810,"trailing_pe":13.862817,"forward_pe":12.942017,"price_to_book":3.5352604,"ev_to_ebitda":9.307,"ev_to_revenue":2.438,"dividend_yield":0.0227,"payout_ratio":0.3177,"beta_yahoo":0.866},"targets":{"current_price":38.4,"mean":51.0,"median":50.0,"high":60.0,"low":44.0,"n_analysts":4,"reco_mean":null,"reco_key":"none"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-12"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":305000000,"ex_dividend":"2026-06-29","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.89298,"institutions_pct":0.06667,"institutions_float_pct":0.62298,"institutions_n":52,"institutions":[{"name":"Legato Capital Management LLC","pct":0.0011999999,"shares":67103,"value":2576755,"date":"2022-09-30","chg":0.135}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0033000002,"shares":163360,"value":6273024,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.2189},{"name":"FINANCIAL INVESTORS TRUST-Grandeur Peak International Stalwarts Fund","pct":0.0026,"shares":127261,"value":4886822,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.2583},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.0021,"shares":105748,"value":4060723,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.2094},{"name":"FINANCIAL INVESTORS TRUST-Grandeur Peak Global Opportunities Fund","pct":0.0014,"shares":70866,"value":2721254,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0432},{"name":"FINANCIAL INVESTORS TRUST-Grandeur Peak Global Contrarian Fund","pct":0.001,"shares":50562,"value":1941580,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.049200002},{"name":"VANGUARD Intl Eqy. INDEX Fd.S-Vanguard FTSE All-World ex-US Small-Cap ","pct":0.0008,"shares":41706,"value":1601510,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.21020001